    <string name="contact_page_reset">Reset</string>
    <string name="contact_page_settings_body">Drag a section by its handle to move it. Tap it to choose whether it starts open, folded or hidden. Hiding a section never deletes anything. Phone, Email, Address and Message or call on… share one Contact info group while they sit together, as do Dates, About them and Note for calls. Folding or unfolding a section on a contact\'s page is remembered for every contact.</string>
